- [AELTC (wimbledon)](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/aeltc-wimbledon/): During The Championships in July 2018, we ran a multi-format outdoor advertising campaign across key National Rail and London Underground stations, Wimbledon, and Southfields.
- [mitsubishi](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/mitsubishi/): Mitsubishi's advertising with Global ran on-air, on outdoor, and on DAX, with the aim of raising product awareness and brand consideration.
