- [BT](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/bt/): BT ran a three month high-reach campaign on DAX. The series of advertising bursts promoted BT as a preferred broadband supplier.
- [HSBC](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/hsbc/): HSBC partnered with Global across DAX, the digital advertising exchange, on a range of podcasts and music streaming services.
- [purplebricks](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/purplebricks/): Purplebricks advertised with Global on tube carriage panels with the objective of raising awareness, consideration and brand engagement.
- [lancôme](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/lancome/): Lancôme wanted to promote their fragrance, La Vie Est Belle, ahead of Mother’s Day. Global ran a DAX campaign to drive awareness.
- [santander](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/santander/): Santander ran a six week campaign on Global's digital advertising exchange, DAX, targeting users across DAX & DAX Podcasts.
- [toyota hilux](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/toyota-hilux/): Toyota Hilux ran a three week DAX campaign. To drive relevance, they used audience segments from Xaxis and lifestyle segments.
- [esme loans](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/esme-loans/): Esme Loans advertised with Global to raise brand awareness and drive customer interactions using bus and London Underground advertising.
- [farmdrop](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/farmdrop/)
- [supermarket brand](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/supermarket-brand/): When a supermarket brand wanted their Christmas campaign to stand out, Global created a synced audio & outdoor campaign which had never been done before in this capacity. This included syncing digital billboard formats with radio.
- [talktalk](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/talktalk/): We drove significant increases in all of the target metrics including consideration, perception and campaign message cut through among listeners who recalled the activity.
- [versus arthritis](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/versus-arthritis/): Successfully generating conversations about arthritis and campaign participation with radio advertising.
- [vicks](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/vicks/): Vicks advertised across Global's transport estate in order to be front of mind when commuters are suffering from the beginnings of a cold.
- [seat](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/seat/): SEAT utilised the effect of advertising on Global's radio & outdoor in unison, by syncing up a Newslink campaign with Global's digital billboards.
- [moonpig](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/moonpig/): Moonpig successfully partnered with Global to promote its brand through radio advertising on the Heart daytime show.
- [eBay](https://global.com/advertise/insight/case-studies/ebay/): Our Breakfast Show sponsorship activity on Capital Breakfast with Roman Kemp and Capital XTRA Breakfast was a success – significantly outperforming the retail benchmark for campaign recall, and driving increases in consideration of eBay.


